# URL patterns the link check skips. One regular expression per line.
# Path exceptions live in lychee.toml. The org rules live in lychee/org.toml.

# data.boston.gov answers 403 to every automated client, including curl and a
# browser User-Agent. The page loads in a browser.
^https://data\.boston\.gov/dataset/open-space$

# data.census.gov answers 403 to lychee, even with a browser User-Agent. It
# answers 200 to curl and in a browser.
^https://data\.census\.gov/$

# Substack answers 403 to GitHub Actions runners. The same URL answers 200
# from a browser and from lychee on other networks.
^https://[a-z0-9-]+\.substack\.com/
